{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2021-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1622505600, "end_date": 1623110399, "month_true_total": 237, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:00:18 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "93376667", "author": {"steamid": "76561198073596960", "personaname": "Avarybadmeme", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198073596960/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 1384, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 485, "last_played": 1723154063, "avatar": "24c81ca0ade4b348ec8435848f140398fb9e4cfe"}, "language": "english", "review": "Kill heretic  \nLife good\nHeretic fight back\nKill heretic", "timestamp_created": 1623102579, "timestamp_updated": 1623102579, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "93350199", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996234033", "personaname": "Enot", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fuwaneko/", "num_games_owned": 1207, "num_reviews": 103, "playtime_forever": 175, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 79, "last_played": 1623534543, "avatar": "5766fa7fe7fe8a6c2a89d93a12d76c2e6f716408"}, "language": "english", "review": "We keep getting all sorts of bad games in WH40K universe, and one of the worthy games is never getting a sequel. Shame.", "timestamp_created": 1623067162, "timestamp_updated": 1623067162, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.489738792181015015", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "93345175", "author": {"steamid": "76561199125734447", "personaname": "David Xanatos", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199125734447/", "num_games_owned": 151, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 524, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 524, "last_played": 1623057904, "avatar": "6efa678aa2bdc13221d1673152b77cf80645f0d3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game, I'm sad it never got a sequel, especially since the ending set us up for one. There is a bunch of mediocre warhammer themed games, but this one is a rare gem.", "timestamp_created": 1623058515, "timestamp_updated": 1623058515, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "93345038", "author": {"steamid": "76561198061066758", "personaname": "Force Commander", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/OnceuponatimeIwasme/", "num_games_owned": 212, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 32478, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5786, "last_played": 1778538536, "avatar": "196b303c51606fe5f09be9ff9a2171e095dda01a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing. ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ amazing. Perfect story telling. Amazing lore accurate weapons and armor. Amazing voice acting. All the good stuff", "timestamp_created": 1623058252, "timestamp_updated": 1623058252, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504950463771820068", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "93342218", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996930142", "personaname": "VulgarMonkey", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/vulgarmonkey/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 127, "playtime_forever": 438, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 245, "last_played": 1623221924, "avatar": "bdf248a9fafd26385c8f5fb9f74de5b3f140782a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Oh hell yeah.\n\nThis game radiates 40k energy and feels like a must-play for any fan of the table-top, the models, or the lore.\n\nThat aside, I might struggle to suggest it to people new to 40k as this game is 10 years old now and it kind of shows. One might feel disconnected to flat graphics, poor lighting, and shallow combat without a pre-existing connection to the Imperium.\n\nPersonally, I hope we see more like this at some point. I welcome more action-orientated Warhammer games - a polar opposite to the many turn-based or real-time strategies out there.", "timestamp_created": 1623052857, "timestamp_updated": 1623052857, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}